jobDescription:
"1. Hands on experience in Sales Cloud&nbsp;
2. Hands on experience in Configurations of Sales, Service setups
2. Backup SF Data Weekly and Monthly&nbsp;
3. Salesforce patches (3 times a year). Impact analysis and testing on the updates&nbsp;
4. Review &amp; Creation of Salesforce design and entity models &amp; Configuration
5. CPQ
- account creation, deletion, Access
