11. Integration support for outlook, Hubspot and others
13. Salesforce Certifications in Admin, Admin+, Platform is a must
14. Data upload using data loader, import wizard 16 Drive Solution using Configuration, lightning flows, Lead Management, Opportunity management 17.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Experience of working in Support, Managed services projects 19 Configuring new Reports dashboards 20 Configure security with profiles, roles and Single Sign on"

